@startuml
title Decorator — DataSource

interface DataSource {
  + write(data: bytes)
  + read() : bytes
}

class FileDataSource {
  + write(data: bytes)
  + read() : bytes
}

abstract class DataSourceDecorator {
  - wrappee : DataSource
  + write(data: bytes)
  + read() : bytes
}

class CompressionDecorator
class EncryptionDecorator
class CachingDecorator

DataSource <|.. FileDataSource
DataSource <|.. DataSourceDecorator
DataSourceDecorator o-- DataSource : "wrap"

DataSourceDecorator <|-- CompressionDecorator
DataSourceDecorator <|-- EncryptionDecorator
DataSourceDecorator <|-- CachingDecorator

note right of DataSourceDecorator
Responsibilities added BEFORE/AFTER
delegation to the wrapped component.
end note
@enduml
